    "updated_at": "2015-10-10T08:48:23Z",
    "body": "- Note that `<button menu>` goes with `<button type=menu>`, the latter of which definitely seems to do something in Firefox.\n- \"toolbar\" used to be something special, but that got removed. Now it's simply the default value and indicates the element is another list/grouping element of sorts. So yeah, nothing fancy.\n",
